:: Hello [NPC:Nagedra]
Careful where you step, {PlayerName}. Everything I own is in a pile on the ground.
I'm Nagedra. Carpenter, when I have a workshop. Could you craft me a wooden chest to carry my belongings?
[[I'll make you one.|ChestStart]]
[[Know any good dungeons?|Dungeons]]
[[Could you help me change my look?|Restyle]]
[[Not right now.|END]]

:: ChestStart [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "start nagedra_chest")
A plain wooden chest will do. Bring it to me when it's done.

:: ChestWait [NPC:Nagedra]
Got that chest for me?
(if: $has_woodenchest)[[Here it is.|ChestGive]]
[[Know any good dungeons?|Dungeons]]
[[Could you help me change my look?|Restyle]]
[[Still working on it.|END]]

:: ChestGive [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "give nagedra_chest")
Let's see it.

:: Tools [NPC:Nagedra]
My toolkit took a beating on the way here. Bring me 10 softwood and 5 metal parts and I'll fix it up.
I'll draw you some blueprints for your workshop in return.
[[Deal.|ToolsStart]]
[[Know any good dungeons?|Dungeons]]
[[Could you help me change my look?|Restyle]]
[[Maybe later.|END]]

:: ToolsStart [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "start nagedra_tools")
Softwood and metal parts. You know where to find them better than I do.

:: ToolsWait [NPC:Nagedra]
How are those materials coming along?
(if: $has_softwood_10 and $has_metal_5)[[I have them.|ToolsGive]]
[[Know any good dungeons?|Dungeons]]
[[Could you help me change my look?|Restyle]]
[[Not yet.|END]]

:: ToolsGive [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "give nagedra_tools")
Put them in here.

:: GaveThanks [NPC:Nagedra]
(set: $just_gave to false)
(if: $quest_nagedra_tools_done)[[x|AllDone]]
(if: $quest_nagedra_chest_done)[[x|ChestThanks]]
[[x|ChestWait]]

:: ChestThanks [NPC:Nagedra]
It's perfect! Here, take the sawmill blueprint. You'll need planks if you mean to build anything.
[[Thanks, Nagedra.|Tools]]

:: GiveFailed [NPC:Nagedra]
(set: $give_failed to false)
That's not quite what I asked for.

:: AllDone [NPC:Nagedra]
Those blueprints should keep you busy. Come back when you've built something.
[[Know any good dungeons?|Dungeons]]
[[Could you help me change my look?|Restyle]]
[[See you, Nagedra.|END]]

:: Dungeons [NPC:Nagedra]
There's one I'd only send you to if you're ready: Kaldhor's Throne. A mad king sits on it now, and his army fills the halls. It's very tough... but what he guards is worth it.
Or the dark forest where I was holed up... I'd say it's my forest by now. And plenty of others, if you've got the nerve. Where do you want to go? I'll send you there.
[[Kaldhor's Throne.|GoKL]]
[[Your forest.|GoNegedra]]
[[Mordaxius' lab.|GoLab]]
[[The library.|GoLibrary]]
[[Morcha's hideout.|GoMorcha]]
[[What else is there?|MoreDungeons]]
[[Somewhere to just fight?|Arena]]
[[Never mind.|END]]

:: Arena [NPC:Nagedra]
The arena, then. I can send you to a boss rush, one brute after another, or to waves of those little soldiers in their coloured coats.
And just so you know... there is no chicken level.
[[The boss rush.|GoRush]]
[[The soldiers' waves.|GoTiny]]
[[...is there a chicken level?|GoChickens]]
[[Never mind.|END]]

:: GoRush [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command arena rush")
One after another, and each one meaner. Don't stop to catch your breath.

:: GoTiny [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command arena tiny")
Small, but there are a lot of them. Mind the ones with the barrels.

:: GoChickens [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command arena chickens")
I told you. There is no chicken level.

:: MoreDungeons [NPC:Nagedra]
Let me think... the old mines, the overgrown caves, Tolcan's forest, and the basements.
[[The mines.|GoMines]]
[[The overgrown caves.|GoNature]]
[[Tolcan's forest.|GoTolcan]]
[[The stone basement.|GoBasement]]
[[Never mind.|END]]

:: GoNegedra [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command dungeon b01_df_negedra")
Watch the roots. And don't touch my stuff.

:: GoLab [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command dungeon b01_lab_full")
Mordaxius never cleaned up after himself. Mind the glowing bits.

:: GoLibrary [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command dungeon dungeon_b01_library")
Bring me back a book on joinery, if they have one.

:: GoMorcha [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command dungeon dungeon_b01_morchahideout")
Morcha won't be happy to see you. Good luck.

:: GoKL [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command dungeon dungeon_b01_kl")
Kaldhor's Throne. Fight your way through his halls, then the throne room. Beat the Mad King and his sword is yours. Good luck... you'll need it.

:: GoMines [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command dungeon b01_sd_mining_01")
If you find good iron down there, it's mine.

:: GoNature [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command dungeon b01_sd_nature_01")
Lovely timber in there. Shame about everything that wants to eat you.

:: GoTolcan [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command dungeon b01_df_tolcan")
Tolcan's woods. Darker than mine, if you can believe it.

:: GoBasement [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command dungeon dungeonGeneration_stonebasement_first")
Cold stone and colder company down there.

:: Restyle [NPC:Nagedra]
(trigger: "command restyle")
A new look? Sit down, let me get my good scissors. And take your hat off first, or you won't see what I'm doing to your hair.
